# the message ledger holds human reply text and Telegram user ids — it belongs in
# the PRIVATE repo only. `git add -A` runs every ten minutes in crawl.yml; without
# this line the first run after msglog is wired publishes identity data.
alerts/msglog/

# Detector status and the salted-hash oracle are PRIVATE (standing rule, 2026-09):
#  * state-public.json was a hashed projection of every finding (hash, signal, tier,
#    first_seen to the minute, acked) — a calibration oracle. No longer written.
#  * labels-lite / watchlist / mindset are restored at run time from
#    moca-ledger-private:oracle/ by `notify/state_sync.py pull-oracle`. They share
#    one salt, and mindset's creation hours link hashes back to wallets.
alerts/state-public.json
labels/labels-lite.json
detect/watchlist.json
detect/mindset.json
